                                                "sense_id": "f2d77d2f-6b68-3b22-bf8f-1911d2c84461",
                                                "text": "Like any outdoor activity, geocaching involves some inherent risk, and many geocachers enjoy manageable risks."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "661e30e1-32ef-3dd6-9de3-eb77c169e3f4",
                                        "entry_id": "225dbc17-b838-3ba7-86c2-c7dba5f195cc",
